    <headline>Thunderstorm This Evening in Gorontalo</headline>
    <description>Thunderstorms and heavy rainfall are forecasted to occur starting from 24 September 2026, 15:27 WITA in parts of Gorontalo especially in: DENGILO, MANANGGU.
 These conditions may lead to reduced visibility, strong winds, and localized flooding.
 The public is strongly advised to remain vigilant during this period, limit outdoor activities, and take all necessary precautions to ensure safety.
 Conditions are expected to gradually improve by 24 September 2026, 17:27 WITA.</description>
